                <head>Agreement between the United States and Honduras respecting a cooperative
                    health and sanitation program in Honduras, further amending and extending the
                    agreement of May 8, 1942</head>
                <p>[Effected by exchange of notes signed at Tegucigalpa May 13, 1947. For text of
                    notes, see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts Series
                    (TIAS) No. 1646, or 61 Stat. (pt. 3) 3114. For texts of notes of May 5 and 8,
                    1942, and April 18 and 19, 1944, see TIAS No. 1557, or 61 Stat. (pt. 3)
                    2319.]</p>
            </div>
